WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-02 - Plastic Sky
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: 1987: Electric Color

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.300
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:15.392 --> 00:00:21.500
The camera's on, the smile is bright

