Another take in the burning light

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:33.800
They painted the set with a perfect blue

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.000
But it doesn't feel real, it doesn't feel true

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.200
We're living under a plastic sky (Oh-oh-oh)

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.200
They tell me "jump," I ask "how high?" (Oh-oh-oh)

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.000
It's just a set, it's all a lie

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Living under a plastic sky

00:00:59.473 --> 00:01:05.000
My guitar is clean, the drums are thin

00:01:07.118 --> 00:01:13.000
They polished away all the grit and sin

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.800
I want to scream, I want to roar

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:22.200
But they just ask me to sing some more

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:26.200
We're living under a plastic sky (Oh-oh-oh)

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.000
They tell me "jump," I ask "how high?" (Oh-oh-oh)

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.100
It's just a set, it's all a lie

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:40.000
Living under a plastic sky

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:45.200
Is this the dream we were chasing?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:49.000
A different part, a different face

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:54.800
I'm losing me, I'm losing you

00:01:54.800 --> 00:02:02.000
In all this shiny, plastic blue

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:17.500
[Guitar Solo]

00:02:17.719 --> 00:02:21.500
We're living under a plastic sky (Oh-oh-oh)

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.200
